flowchart TD
 USB[USB-C power only: CC detection / input protection] --> CHG[Power-path charger: design unresolved]
 PACK[Protected cell + qualified NTC: not selected] <--> CHG
 CHG --> MRAIL[Modem rail 3.3–4.3 V; transient and cutoff validation]
 MRAIL --> MODEM[EG912U-GL candidate]
 CHG --> MCU3[MCU regulator]
 MCU3 --> MCU[ESP32-S3 module]
 MCU <--> LVL[1.8 V UART translation]
 LVL <--> MODEM
 MCU --> KEYS[5 x 3 single-key matrix]
 MCU --> DSP[Display level translation + 3.0 V rail]
 DSP --> LCD[NHD raw SPI panel]
 CHG --> BL[Current-controlled backlight driver]
 BL --> LCD
 MODEM --> SIM[SIM socket + ESD]
 MODEM --> RF[50 ohm feed + matching + U.FL + qualified antenna]
 MIC[Biased electret mic + filter] --> MODEM
 MODEM --> EAR[32 ohm earpiece + acoustic/drive validation]
 MODEM --> DBG[Reserved USB service interface]
